'''Sea Maiden Ruri''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Update 6.0]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]] increases her attack power, health and [[Weaken|weaken]] time on [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

