==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]], Mer-Queen Ruri was one of the few [[:Category:Cats with Ultra Talents|Cats with Ultra Talents]] to lack a second [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] slot.
*The word "[[wikipedia:NEET|NEET]]" in her description is an acronym meaning "Not in Employment, Education or Training".
*Sea Maiden Ruri is one of the first cats to have the [[Multi-Hit]] ability, which itself was added alongside her in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].
*Mer-Queen Ruri's design is likely a reference to [[wikia:onepiece:Shirahoshi|Princess Shirahoshi]] from [[wikipedia:One Piece|One Piece]].

